{"schema": "telegram_raw_message.v1", "source_kind": "live_capture", "message_id": "401", "channel_alias": "Photon_Trading_2023", "raw_text": "How can we use liquidity?\nInstead of entering the market right away and risking getting stopped out when the price sweeps through liquidity at the level where your stop-loss is placed-only to have the price move in your intended direction afterward— we wait for a liquidity sweep to occur first.\nLiquidity Sweep\nBy waiting for this sweep, we can enter the market after these stop-loss orders have been triggered, resulting in a higher probability setup and reducing the chance of being used as liquidity ourselves.", "sender": "Photon_Trading_2023", "timestamp_utc": "2025-04-14T08:59:40+00:00", "has_image": false}
